# Link policy

Safe destinations\: [HTTPS label \(with punctuation\)](<https://example.test/a%20b%3Cc%3E>) and [Mail label](<mailto:reader@example.test>)\.


Relative destinations\: [Guide](<docs/guide.org>)\, [Ampersand path](<docs/road&amp;map.org>)\, and [Rooted path](</rooted%20path>)\.


Local destination\: [This heading](<#link-policy>)\.


Unsafe destinations\: JavaScript label\, Named entity label\, Decimal entity label\, Hex entity label\, Network label\, and Backslash label\.


Query strings preserve entity\-like text\: [Entity\-like query](<https://example.test/search?q=one&amp;colon;two>)\.